  "data": {
    "ruleType": "enhancement",
    "group": "Sanctified Orators",
    "summary": "For an ADEPTA SORORITAS CHARACTER model, never a PENITENT unit. Once per turn for each unit, you may activate it as any phase starts and pick one benefit; no duration is stated, so under the core rule for persisting effects it lasts only for that phase. Rite of Revelation: as this unit shoots, enemy units have their detection range increased by 6 inches. Sermon of Intolerance: battle-shock rolls for this unit succeed automatically. Catechism of Raging Fervour: add 1 inch to this unit's Move. Psalm of Righteous Smiting: +1 Strength on attacks made by this unit. Chorus of Repudiation: an attack against this unit whose Strength exceeds the unit's Toughness suffers -1 on its wound roll.",
